<item><title>Zimbabwe power utility says network overhaul needs US$2.4 billion</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/zimbabwe-power-utility-says-network-overhaul-needs-us-2-4-dbdd67/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/zimbabwe-power-utility-says-network-overhaul-needs-us-2-4-dbdd67/</guid><category>Zimbabwe</category><description>ZETDC says two decades of underfunding left transmission and distribution assets short of maintenance, refurbishment and expansion.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 06:25:39 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/zimbabwe-power-utility-says-network-overhaul-needs-us-2-4-dbdd67/share.jpg" length="43897" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/zimbabwe-power-utility-says-network-overhaul-needs-us-2-4-dbdd67/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
