<item><title>Zimbabwe releases Muchekeranwa finger millet variety with yields up to 2.9 tonnes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/zimbabwe-releases-muchekeranwa-finger-millet-variety-with-264c70/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/zimbabwe-releases-muchekeranwa-finger-millet-variety-with-264c70/</guid><category>Zimbabwe</category><description>Developed by ICRISAT and Marondera University Seed Company, the variety could bring farmers about US$956 more gross revenue per hectare at April 2026 prices.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:19:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/zw.jpg" length="34422" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/zw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
